<title>USA: Fort Howard Corp Q4 net up.</title>
<headline>Fort Howard Corp Q4 net up.</headline>
<dateline>GREEN BAY, Wis. 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.81		    $0.33</p>
<p> Net			 59,549		   20,864</p>
<p> Revs		     384,464		  415,301</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q4 earnings before unusual and extraordinary items was $0.52/shr. 1996 Q4 includes loss of $4.8 million, or $0.06/shr, on debt repurchases.  </p>
<p>			YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			 $ 2.32		   $ 0.25</p>
<p> Net			162,597		   14,717</p>
<p> Revs		   1,580,771		1,620,903</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full-year EPS before unusual and extraordinary items were $20.7 for 1996 and $0.57 for 1995.</p>
<p>In the 1996 Q4, unusual items included an environmental charge of $18 million or $0.14/shr and a tax benefit of $36 million or $0.49/shr.</p>
<p>Full-year results include losses on debt repurchases of $8.1 million or $0.12/shr vs loss of $18.7 million or $0.32/shr.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
